Attention, Security Investigation Division.

00:38:00.000 --> 00:38:02.660
D'amour, d'amour, d'amour

00:38:03.100 --> 00:38:07.080
Avec toi seul je veux apprendre

00:38:08.080 --> 00:38:10.740
Un jour, deux jours, toujours

00:38:12.470 --> 00:38:14.820
Dis-moi, dis-moi

00:38:14.820 --> 00:38:17.400
Que tu m'aimes aussi

00:38:18.580 --> 00:38:22.360
Même si tu m'en suis

00:38:23.100 --> 00:38:25.750
Hi neighbor, sit down

00:38:25.750 --> 00:38:27.020
Hello Mr. Peters

00:38:30.000 --> 00:38:33.380
You sound awfully glum. Didn't you have a good time in Paris?

00:38:34.300 --> 00:38:35.420
I wasn't even there.

00:38:36.100 --> 00:38:37.580
Lamar's another day, Horace. Have a drink.

00:38:38.820 --> 00:38:43.620
Thanks. That's just it. Tomorrow and then the day after. Goodbye.

00:38:44.780 --> 00:38:45.980
You're not tired of our country?

00:38:47.260 --> 00:38:49.360
Just beginning to have fun when we get called back.

00:38:49.730 --> 00:38:51.940
That's too bad. Well, maybe you'll be back again.

00:38:52.660 --> 00:38:54.600
Or maybe we'll all meet again in America.

00:38:56.230 --> 00:38:57.110
I'll drink to that.

00:38:58.060 --> 00:38:59.890
Till the next time we meet on...

00:39:00.000 --> 00:39:00.880
on the other side of the Atlantic.

00:39:02.040 --> 00:39:03.180
Till the next time we meet.

00:39:30.120 --> 00:39:30.260
Thank you.

00:40:00.250 --> 00:40:03.740
The courier flies out in the morning with duplicate microfilm.

00:40:03.960 --> 00:40:05.780
It's set for next Tuesday, 3 p.m.

00:40:19.400 --> 00:40:19.780
All right?

00:40:20.240 --> 00:40:20.320
Yeah.

00:40:22.630 --> 00:40:23.370
Somebody slugged us.

00:40:23.760 --> 00:40:25.240
I tried to hang on to the guy, but I couldn't.

00:40:27.780 --> 00:40:28.980
Margo, we had our call.

00:40:30.000 --> 00:40:31.980
Microfilm, probably the whole setup on it.

00:40:34.760 --> 00:40:36.400
She handed that microfilm to a seaman.

00:40:37.580 --> 00:40:39.360
This material is from an officer's uniform.

00:40:39.540 --> 00:40:39.920
An officer?

00:40:40.560 --> 00:40:42.000
Yeah, and there are only six on the boat.

00:40:43.420 --> 00:40:44.500
I'll meet you back at the shop.

00:40:49.350 --> 00:40:49.850
Hi, Chief.

00:40:50.570 --> 00:40:51.470
Hello, Mr. Peter.

00:40:55.540 --> 00:40:57.060
Last night before we shove off?

00:40:58.130 --> 00:40:59.190
That's all the same to me.

00:41:00.960 --> 00:41:02.320
Why aren't you sure of celebrating?

00:41:03.410 --> 00:41:05.110
Well, I leave that to all the younger ones.

00:41:05.470 --> 00:41:09.070
I got an arm full of tattoos from two kids back in New London, Connecticut.

00:41:10.670 --> 00:41:11.970
Who's off the boat?

