00:55:23.220 --> 00:55:28.400
keeps operating behind the screen we had set up. They even penetrated your own crew. I

00:55:28.400 --> 00:55:29.960
saw Margo Wayne hand microfilm.

00:55:30.000 --> 00:55:30.840
to one of the seamen.

00:55:30.940 --> 00:55:32.440
You sure you're not mistaking the games

00:55:32.440 --> 00:55:33.180
