00:55:33.420 --> 00:55:34.260
Check for yourself.

00:55:34.620 --> 00:55:35.800
Have Margo Wayne picked up.

00:55:35.900 --> 00:55:36.780
The luggage maker, too.

00:55:37.020 --> 00:55:38.500
He made 52 of those cases.

00:55:38.620 --> 00:55:40.340
48 for you and 4 for Buzz Olin.

00:55:40.620 --> 00:55:41.640
Get through to Marseille.

00:55:41.780 --> 00:55:42.180
Yes, sir.

