00:55:46.760 --> 00:55:47.280
That's right.

00:55:47.540 --> 00:55:48.940
That's a myth, isn't it?

00:55:50.850 --> 00:55:52.010
I've lost track of the days.

00:55:52.130 --> 00:55:52.730
