00:55:54.540 --> 00:55:56.140
Because on Tuesday at 3 p.m.,

00:55:56.140 --> 00:55:57.340
that bomb becomes real.

00:56:23.920 --> 00:56:27.810
We haven't got much time. We've got to locate Wayne and Olin before noon tomorrow.

