Commander Jackson and I were the only ones from the sub in on the game.

00:56:37.150 --> 00:56:40.940
Then it has to be the seaman. He should know where Wayne and Nolan are headquartered.

00:56:42.090 --> 00:56:43.630
I can't believe it's one of my crew.

00:56:44.190 --> 00:56:46.810
He's right. We have less than 24 hours to get to them.

00:56:47.220 --> 00:56:49.500
Cancel all liberty. You ought to roll hands back on board immediately.

00:56:49.760 --> 00:56:50.120
Aye, sir.

